flowchart LR
  USER[User / client] --> EDGE[Future API boundary]
  EDGE --> AUTH[Identity + authorization]
  AUTH --> CORE[Core services]
  CORE --> TOOL[Tool sandbox]
  CORE --> MEM[Memory boundary]
  CORE --> CONN[Connector boundary]
  TOOL --> EXT[External tools]
  CONN --> EXT
  SECRETS[Secret manager] -. scoped access .-> CONN
  SECRETS -. scoped access .-> TOOL
  AUDIT[Redacted audit] -. observes policy decisions .-> AUTH
  HUMAN[Human approval] -. required for sensitive actions .-> TOOL
